.Dd June 9, 2026
.Dt MBT_PICKER 3
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm mbt_picker_sequential ,
.Nm mbt_picker_random ,
.Nm mbt_picker_rarest
.Nd piece picker interface for torrent download strategy
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In mbt/picker.h
.Ft int
.Fn mbt_picker_sequential "const struct mbt_torrent *t" "void *peer" "void *ctx"
.Ft int
.Fn mbt_picker_random "const struct mbt_torrent *t" "void *peer" "void *ctx"
.Ft int
.Fn mbt_picker_rarest "const struct mbt_torrent *t" "void *peer" "void *ctx"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Picker functions select which piece to request next from a peer.
.Pp
.Fn mbt_picker_sequential
returns pieces in order from first to last.
.Fn mbt_picker_random
picks a random piece the peer has that we need.
.Fn mbt_picker_rarest
picks the rarest piece among connected peers (standard BitTorrent strategy).
.Pp
Each returns the piece index, or \-1 if no suitable piece is available.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr mbt_torrent 3
